[{"title":"申前意呈石遗","author":"林旭","text":"流水游龙去等闲，同车惠我待君还。\n王官行李愁奔命，胡妇燕支笑破颜。\n宿雨反风寒作雪，高楼含雾远如山。\n纵然沾醉忧能入，不及逃虚日掩关。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42795,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎邱道上 其一","author":"林旭","text":"吴人艳说山塘好，不到山塘恐受欺。\n向日搜寻无一字，却来此地得新诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42796,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"虎邱道上 其二","author":"林旭","text":"愿使江涛荡寇仇，啾啾新鬼哭荒邱。\n新愁旧恨相随续，举目真看麋鹿游。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42797,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二月十八日读史","author":"林旭","text":"韩诛彭醢瞻言渐，东海萧生致可忧。\n但有太师驭边手，门生何术更吹求。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42798,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"往岁郑太夷丈居江南督幕赋枇杷诗绝爱之顷来大通督销局所见殊夥欲去乃题此","author":"林旭","text":"荒洲风物见枇杷，青实茸茸指有加。\n欲傍小轩题晚翠，已成昨日忆天涯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42799,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵先生日成数诗辄呼予视之 其一","author":"林旭","text":"闭户空参曹洞禅，从人嗔劝乐吾便。\n诗题满眼浑无字，那对先生万斛泉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42800,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵先生日成数诗辄呼予视之 其二","author":"林旭","text":"顷刻催成纸面花，咿唔唤起笔间霞。\n撚须自向灯前读，相见潘郎满果车。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42801,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵先生日成数诗辄呼予视之 其三","author":"林旭","text":"随舟芍药伴诗翁，更盗荼蘼阳虎东。\n冷淡生涯人四个，谁家翠幕覆重重。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42802,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叩冯庵门就睡矣诵一律使予书之和作","author":"林旭","text":"诗翁不慕酒中仙，贪把深杯取易眠。\n灯下杜鹃对骄绝，碗中荈叶饮泠然。\n是他魔著难成梦，愧我墙窥但及肩。\n说似诚斋吾亦允，心头约略识清妍。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42803,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"题陈公宽小照","author":"林旭","text":"红袖满楼同醉日，要论僧舍读书时。\n相看一笑知身世，烟柳斜阳景付谁。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42804,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷叶洲杂诗 其一","author":"林旭","text":"云绕青山山绕江，一洲中著四淙淙。\n登楼忽忆青龙阁，清景原来亦有双。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42805,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷叶洲杂诗 其二","author":"林旭","text":"新建勒中丞方锜，雕镌荷叶我犹嫌。\n只从和悦渠侬语，春尽潺潺不卷帘。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42806,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷叶洲杂诗 其三","author":"林旭","text":"九华见说春茶盛，新摘毛尖一日程。\n慰我窗中吟望意，风生两胁即飞行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42807,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"荷叶洲杂诗 其四","author":"林旭","text":"依然天际识归舟，落日荒山柱础稠。\n足底江流似裙带，何人朱字写空侯。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42808,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将去大通久雨始晴治诗就毕 其一","author":"林旭","text":"一春不恨不曾晴，晴去荒洲作么生。\n今日肯晴宁有意，可知天也速人行。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42809,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将去大通久雨始晴治诗就毕 其二","author":"林旭","text":"诗无数首那言删，吟到三年岂便安。\n早日何曾知句法，旁人谓不费心肝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42810,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"将去大通久雨始晴治诗就毕 其三","author":"林旭","text":"君看象教但涂金，法教谁知个里深。\n我为世尊还白净，何方能免一尘侵。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42811,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"舟中读诚斋诗","author":"林旭","text":"装中一卷荆溪诗，拂拭船窗得暂披。\n不道霞光侵漆几，忽看赤鲤出清池。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42812,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵移居穿虹滨以诗贺之是日四月八也 其一","author":"林旭","text":"碧鸡光景日迷离，白雗山梁翔集时。\n桃印施门须湿字，商量端合署钟馗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42813,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵移居穿虹滨以诗贺之是日四月八也 其二","author":"林旭","text":"薄薄猪肝要自供，先生约法灶君从。\n今朝有喜和人共，浊酒西头寿士龙。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42814,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵移居穿虹滨以诗贺之是日四月八也 其三","author":"林旭","text":"法王降世恒星隐，诗老移家气象干。\n添与今朝作故事，可知位力一般般。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42815,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵移居穿虹滨以诗贺之是日四月八也 其四","author":"林旭","text":"客窗共咏枇杷树，风味依依故可思。\n此后诗成驰急足，便令辟重也嫌迟。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42816,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"冯庵移居穿虹滨以诗贺之是日四月八也 其五","author":"林旭","text":"冯庵三益里中径，无闷四条巷里春。\n定识写经居士叶，无穷诗句出清新。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42817,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"日本绵笺制画殊有古意","author":"林旭","text":"捣绵为质茧为肤，小景精工俗制无。\n春浅桃花轻著粉，江寒凫影婉将雏。\n法传撮?书原好，字盛迦卢用自殊。\n玩好故知能弱国，从人画革亦区区。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42818,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"自穿虹滨步归王家库书所见","author":"林旭","text":"归路幢灯火始然，长街过雨步轻便。\n本来高柳黄尘地，误入桃花薄暝天。\n鸣镝场开承浅草，留犁酒绕滴清泉。\n兽旗飘飐知何世，辟地还从受一廛。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42819,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"见月有感","author":"林旭","text":"一饷搅林闻淅沥，几时泄地踏晶寒。\n指头尽有千幢现，云里惟将一鉴看。\n地旷蛙声来鼓吹，池深蟆影窟盘蟠。\n太阴圆缺干渠事，却笑卢仝泪不乾。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42820,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨夜醉归","author":"林旭","text":"桃蹊无语叶如帷，淞水东流剪不归。\n时世画眉将半额，春寒呵手不成围。\n雨声月色和同好，马足灯光一并飞。\n只合腾腾随俗去，休论西子与南威。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42821,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"怀仲奋","author":"林旭","text":"平生少交友，仲奋实和唱。\n久别虽无书，夙意知不忘。\n近闻废蒙楚，能复轻悼丧。\n一年作客三四归，日暮高堂正尔望。\n好学深思世所希，早白已作星星样。\n年来万事况违心，难从问讯知何状。\n故山雨湿梅子熟，忆否同看三峡涨。\n昏因洽比得相从，年家君是丈人行。\n岂惟共学事文句，更期适道正蕲向。\n始君默默尚自谦，感我殷殷不多让。\n深于训诂作词章，孙孔本朝相颉颃。\n箧中纂述今当成，只恐恶怀多废放。\n怀君作诗不寄君，君见诗时憎怆悢。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42822,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"所居草树特盛","author":"林旭","text":"寄居嘉荫托清圆，商略无妨过夏天。\n日出先明千叶露，雨馀尽绿四围烟。\n山中只异辚辚坌，鼻际常闻栩栩鲜。\n也比城南老居士，闭门抱瓮乐真全。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42823,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"相知行","author":"林旭","text":"相如昔日家成都，四壁独具长物无。\n若非文君夜奔往，聘钱难借何论逋。\n郁林女儿生照井，青州公子识光景。\n明珠百斛不与宝，更退翾风作房老。\n书生穷薄不足道，化为鶗鴂啼芳草。\n黄金在手失娉婷，人生几见多财好。\n乐莫乐兮新相知，将新比故犹有疑。\n佳人一去岂再得，只有延年语可悲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42824,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和人观张园车马","author":"林旭","text":"春去初添车马狂，幔缨御者意扬扬。\n看街楼阁人垂手，过眼云烟鉴眩光。\n趯趯散眠芳草地，盈盈归去牡丹坊。\n难知此日园林价，莫转诗人锦绣肠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42825,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨至 其一","author":"林旭","text":"树顶黑云舒忽白，斜光一片化滃濛。\n窗闲客子卷书帙，江上渔翁收钓筒。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42826,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"雨至 其二","author":"林旭","text":"初见白烟流碧海，俄还青叶绕红墙。\n雷霆剩遣蚊虻寂，高枕眠过三日凉。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42827,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"偶得旧纸扇是往年柳屏义门所写题以寄之","author":"林旭","text":"章台拊马当时物，不逐春归柳色空。\n我友别来诗句旧，三年怀袖过秋风。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42828,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蝶二首 其一","author":"林旭","text":"暂借茅亭坐夕晖，被涯芳草水深围。\n花香处处元无见，栩栩何来此地飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42829,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"蝶二首 其二","author":"林旭","text":"轻衫自爱楼头立，团扇频烦女手挥。\n车马沸天灯胜昼，闲闲一蝶傍墙飞。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42830,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其一","author":"林旭","text":"深藏歌舞翠帘垂，耳熟风柔遣得知。\n不望一斑疏处见，堤防捉去罚吟诗。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42831,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其二","author":"林旭","text":"总被春归愁勿聊，对他春鸟厌哓哓。\n情知吉语来何暮，除为填成万里桥。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42832,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"绝句三首 其三","author":"林旭","text":"大谢风流举世传，胡床素髻坐翛然。\n看渠婉婉名驹子，已觉骎骎老辈前。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42833,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"述哀故观察东湖王公定安","author":"林旭","text":"海风吹夏寒，闭户听瑟䫻。\n哀从静中生，有若井泉溢。\n斯人王夫子，白日谢昭质。\n哭寝忽几时，馀怆托简毕。\n昔岁客江宁，闲居重九日。\n高轩隆隆过，文场之魁率。\n幼卑不敢见，僮仆笑喽㗚。\n敦敦拈髯髭，风雅意无匹。\n扬榷极古今，头纷而绪密。\n百川秋灌河，乃睹会归一。\n海内宝宋斋，牙签三万帙。\n招我坐其中，竟日常折堲。\n巍巍文正公，遗教为称述。\n宗法司马迁，文章综事实。\n学诗杜与韩，万化本六律。\n私淑愧非才，再拜心空朏。\n别公夷陵去，千里风吹?。\n有美见山川，嵂崒而滵汩。\n行公钓游处，作诗附归驲。\n中间再见公，钟山雪花?。\n客坐见小同，髧髦垂如茁。\n试文中学官，钟爱时加膝。\n顾言此儿异，老夫让跨轶。\n子昔年如渠，定是更秀出。\n昨日得佳章，开缄忭复咥。\n子自求庄逵，我已任蓝荜。\n蹉跎两仪迁，凄怆九言卒。\n疚心音问寥，极目邱坟窟。\n平生良史才，叙述纷四七。\n古人贵报恩，蔡邕岂直笔。\n国家权煮海，为治至纤悉。\n历载有成书，辛苦见次比。\n义与桓生殊，颇亦言民疾。\n公卿虽不用，退省初无失。\n化行颍水清，彻佩如私恤。\n空舲有夜猿，泪尽血泏泏。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42834,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"得三叔父书","author":"林旭","text":"叔父归乡里，我心日悠悠。\n昨者寄书至，惟其疾之忧。\n跪读三四遍，涕下不能收。\n出门已三载，倦翮乐暂休。\n诸弟肯读书，但苦饥肠㵞。\n选官缘资格，争席伤蛙?。\n还如稻梁雁，因风俟九秋。\n衣食非粗足，安作马少游。\n吾党二三子，进取力所勠。\n书问久不具，爱我犹怨?。\n怀哉刘牢之，少孤实命犹。\n扶将偕我母，门户枝相樛。\n读书成后进，云路视何?。\n操心病咳血，新来可瘉不。\n吾师杨夫子，好学罕匹俦。\n汉书写百过，记诵如水流。\n穷经志不堕，皓首谁见酬。\n小夫拥皋比，妄用相踶鳅。\n近来乡校议，恍若寐而䎿。\n原惟循循意，欲见皆何繇。\n南斋千竿竹，风来声飕飕。\n上有百好鸟，终日鸣啾啾。\n去年防火道，斩伐若去仇。\n好鸟四飞去，巡视安所投。\n向来怜惜之，闻此心内抽。\n今年新笋长，庶几复有鸠。\n因声问此君，岁寒盟可求。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42835,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳屏在宁波度其必过此得书已归太仓矣因寄 其一","author":"林旭","text":"随俗蹉跎会面违，坐才奔走寄声稀。\n徒劳设伏遮归路，不觉平明敌溃围。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42836,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳屏在宁波度其必过此得书已归太仓矣因寄 其二","author":"林旭","text":"加减多君问短长，闲人心力倦论量。\n要知县巷胭脂色，便是江南时世妆。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42837,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳屏问刻诗 其一","author":"林旭","text":"自怜蚓语与蝉嘶，百首烦人为整齐。\n不畏仙官来摄取，夜深疑有树精啼。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42838,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"柳屏问刻诗 其二","author":"林旭","text":"清风明月无穷物，临水登山自得之。\n万里更堪经九折，王良独有辔如丝。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42839,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"携诗视石遗出门为风吹去属有所思竟勿觉也","author":"林旭","text":"运乖只恐沟渠污，思至须防坑谷伤。\n缘汝痴呆却无益，不教建鼓觅逋亡。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42840,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"所居往高昌庙路上作","author":"林旭","text":"坡陀回伏车轮侧，田水清深树色蓝。\n忽忆天津二月道，说他风景似江南。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42841,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"张园呈石遗即效其体","author":"林旭","text":"深篁傍水摇蛛网，三两拒霜照眼明。\n穷巷幽姿端可比，秋风斜日若为情。\n残荷前日看犹在，远客临行思自生。\n且欲留诗当报礼，仁人一序敌连城。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42842,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"和友人韵","author":"林旭","text":"锦车使者归来晚，雾阁云窗又起家。\n楚岫梦回洵美矣，汉宫望久讵非邪。\n君王自失河南地，颜色能骄西海花。\n生不逢时尚倾国，也将续命托琵琶。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42843,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"海西庵东偏小院梁伯烈榜曰藏山伯烈二年不归矣","author":"林旭","text":"端坐能穷万物妍，江波日日看洄旋。\n信知丈室维摩诘，得傍瓜庐焦孝然。\n贤守早亡唯远客，山僧深闭自安眠。\n枇杷千树真过我，来值繁霜十月天。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42844,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"露筋祠","author":"林旭","text":"篝火深宵叩庙门，拜瞻环佩自然尊。\n诗成不得夸神韵，只好从人笑钝根。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42845,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"清口舟中","author":"林旭","text":"晴日张帆意自新，雨中牵埭力犹辛。\n垂杨不断怀终古，白鸟相烦谢有神。\n土垄时逢烧甓地，客嘲真作嗅烟人。\n腾腾枉自超江海，未识风轮胜火轮。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42846,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"高堰晚泊","author":"林旭","text":"迎客都君风肃然，杨舟澹淡夕阳天。\n辨帆日下边何阔，觅港泥中腹渐坚。\n换蟹馋思须近市，伐芦生计羡连船。\n寒湾水宿怀空渺，岂有高人夜叩舷。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42847,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"叙舟中往复诗高堰作","author":"林旭","text":"劳者之歌事必传，天下今无征投篇。\n飞轮绝辔不到处，诗家物色天予全。\n浅娱居士今少年，摴蒲屡负宵无眠。\n吾投以机俄汩汩，有如群鲋涌井泉。\n顷刻百篇皆手写，夸诧儿女呼为仙。\n古云为诗亦为政，主人脱袜晴窗偏。\n篇成波澜湖水阔，纵观未已生云烟。\n李子钝学谅如我，蹇涩不出亦可怜。\n晓闻伐鼓声渊渊，有日无风夜不前。\n岸上指挥逢豪首，疑是博士江村船。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42848,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"河柳","author":"林旭","text":"复艚水落自潺湲，河柳青黄尚可攀。\n圆月欲升先绚彩，莫烟回带稍留殷。\n玲珑疑有楼台出，寂漠惟看鸦雀还。\n摇落物情但如此，飘飘客子岂能闲。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42849,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"腊梅","author":"林旭","text":"雪压黄茅淮水浑，废诗一月寂关门。\n明窗小盎谁分饷，初续江南断后魂。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42850,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"龙仁陔方伯挽词","author":"林旭","text":"精力平生小物穷，空馀丹旐返寒风。\n黄泉袒括知迎母，青史循良合传公。\n火烈犹存辍舂爱，水清自励斩刍忠。\n我稽祀典勤官在，不讼甘陈昔日功。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42851,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"拔可言某寺有鹤又有腊梅荒城得此足珍也","author":"林旭","text":"寒洲春至还归去，只供僧房岁晚天。\n一树婆娑原不醉，三更独自恐无眠。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42852,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"鹿港香","author":"林旭","text":"拌和花香飘细细，雨窗残梦被惊回。\n欣然援笔夸乡物，猛省今从异域来。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42853,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"二月三日出游","author":"林旭","text":"新春瞥眼二月三，粿耳吃完腹历鹿。\n卧闻棚窍风叫鸱，起视墙头云走虪。\n抠衣勉后二三子，步出城门里五六。\n黄茅白水冰始澌，桅木森森一极目。\n风筝百尺拽河干，有似牵船车转轴。\n空中闪闪鳞之而，谁知糊纸还缚竹。\n淮南鸡犬尚升天，东海鱼龙定游陆。\n妄凭噫气上叫号，不畏晴雷下追逐。\n青云仰首不自致，托命长绳终娖娽。\n高飞未免丈夫惭，何况瞻相多蹙蹙。\n徘徊畏雨遂先归，贪恋无风还偃伏。\n岂伊身世犹寥廓，坐念冬春客兹局。\n窗前高下晒衣裤，室中左右堆箱簏。\n青氤梦见草侵阶，春色意生日照屋。\n吾妻忆母只叹嗟，我友攻文极彬戫。\n笑馀度岁资唐史，未夜先眠烛不摍。\n何人邮致水仙栽，无事燂汤日再浴。\n遨头风味又若此，藉口无令诟孤独。\n冯庵先生亦不出，肯和新诗粲盈幅。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42854,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}},{"title":"喜赠拔可","author":"林旭","text":"昆弋名辈今已稀，秦腔三十年来尚。\n高弦急板声犹悲，吹律微畏北风?。\n空舲老人侯生曲，颇详叙述知泛旺。\n南人新贵五月仙，北人自喜天明亮。\n嗟予快耳实非知，止似文章爱奔放。\n荒城作客乐官拙，有耳甘聋目甘䁁。\n舍中无事弦索鸣，堂上伊忧谁最强。\n异哉李子尔何才，独坐乌乌能揣状。\n天生长颈必有谓，日日羁禽转哀吭。\n自言师法极矜夸，似恃乡愚恣欺诳。\n摇头顿足了不惭，听者颇亦嗤其妄。\n我思此意正堪伤，寂寂谁能且复狂。\n善书殿体必贵人，行看飞去九天上。\n不愁持笏作参军，刺史帘前事吟唱。","collection":"清","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"清_1.csv","pointer":42855,"sha256":"5fb98e6c1f019fdac176e7c42c73bfc5154cf881dab9da8d2e50ad0603fbca1d","dynasty":"清"}}]